{"title":"Potash","sourceTitle":"Potash/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Potash\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Potash (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Potash/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Potasa (100% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Potash/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Potasse (21% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Potash/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Калий (21% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Potash/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"钾肥 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.20.12</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Silvita</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-sylvite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/23/Ore-sylvite.png/100px-Ore-sylvite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/23/Ore-sylvite.png/150px-Ore-sylvite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/23/Ore-sylvite.png/200px-Ore-sylvite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Potassa</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Potash.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/100px-Potash.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/150px-Potash.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/200px-Potash.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><b>Potash</b> é um mineral usado como fertilizante para culturas de potássio (K). Pode ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comprado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> ou criado a partir do minério <b>sylvite</b>, que pode ser encontrado dentro dos depósitos <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/halite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/halite\">sal-gema</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Halite\" title=\"Halite\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Comércio\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comércio</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Cozimento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cozimento</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"Trading\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Com.C3.A9rcio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comércio\">Comércio</span></h3>\n<p>O potássio pode ser adquirido em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">comerciantes de commodities</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> pelo preço de 2.25 - 3.75<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gear\">engrenagens</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rusty gear\"> </a></span> por 10 potássio.\n</p><p><span id=\"Cooking\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cozimento\">Cozimento</span></h3>\n<p>O potássio é feito de <b>minério de silvita</b>, que é encontrado em camadas de sal-gema. A silvite pode ser encontrada como pedaços de superfície ou como blocos de minério. Quando extraído com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\">picareta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\"> </a></span> feito de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> ou melhor, cada bloco de minério de silvita produz 2.25 - 2.75<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr> silvita. A silvita deve então ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Quern\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Quern\">Chão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quern\" title=\"Quern\"> </a></span> para criar silvita em pó. Em seguida, 2L de água devem ser cozidos com 2 silvitas em pó para produzir 2 potassa. Tal como acontece com todas as receitas de panelas não alimentares, isto deixará a panela coberta de resíduos e permanentemente inadequada para preparar alimentos.\n</p>\n<div style=\"float:left;\"><div style=\"left:0px; top:0px; width:261px; height:169px; position:relative;\">\n\t<div style=\"left:0px; top:0px; width:261px; height:169px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"/images/d/d7/Cooking_GUI.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"261\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"261\" data-file-height=\"169\" /></span></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:23px; top:31px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/%C3%81gua\" title=\"Água\"><img alt=\"Água\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/46px-Water.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/69px-Water.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/92px-Water.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:76px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/%C3%81gua\" title=\"Água\"><img alt=\"Água\" src=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/46px-Water.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/69px-Water.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9d/Water.png/92px-Water.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:130px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Silvita_em_p%C3%B3\" title=\"Silvita em pó\"><img alt=\"Silvita em pó\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/46px-Powder-sylvite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/69px-Powder-sylvite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/92px-Powder-sylvite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:183px; top:32px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Silite_em_p%C3%B3\" title=\"Silite em pó\"><img alt=\"Silite em pó\" src=\"/images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/46px-Powder-sylvite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/69px-Powder-sylvite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/11/Powder-sylvite.png/92px-Powder-sylvite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t<div style=\"left:183px; top:94px; width:46px; height:46px; position:absolute;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/Potassa\" title=\"Potassa\"><img alt=\"Potassa\" src=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/46px-Potash.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/69px-Potash.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/43/Potash.png/92px-Potash.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div> \n        <div style=\"left: 22px; top: 54px; width: 46px; height: 20px; position: absolute; overflow: hidden; text-align: right; vertical-align: text-bottom; margin: 0px 3px 3px -3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px; color: white; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000, 1px 1px 0 #000;\">1L</span></div>\n        <div style=\"left:76px; top:54px; width:46px; height:20px; position:absolute; overflow:hidden; text-align:right; vertical-align:text-bottom; margin: 0px 3px 3px -3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px; color: white; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000, 1px 1px 0 #000;\">1L</span></div>\n<p><br />        \n</p>\n\t\t<div style=\"left: 182px; top: 117px; width: 46px; height: 20px; position: absolute; overflow: hidden; text-align: right; vertical-align: text-bottom; margin: 0px 3px 3px -3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px; color: white; text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000, 1px 1px 0 #000;\">2</span></div>\n</div>\n</div><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>O único uso do Potash a partir da versão 1.20.12 é como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">fertilizante</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Fertilizer\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> com um valor K de 60%. A primeira vez que o potássio for usado como fertilizante num bloco de terras agrícolas, a sua fertilidade máxima de K aumentará em 15%. A partir de 20.1.12, o potássio é o único item do jogo com esta propriedade.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Quando isso ocorre, outros níveis de nutrientes não são afetados, mas a terra agrícola mudará visualmente para a próxima terra agrícola de maior qualidade (Estéril -&gt; Baixa fertilidade -&gt; Média fertilidade -&gt; Alta fertilidade -&gt; Terra preta). Para obter detalhes, consulte <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Fertilizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">Agricultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Fertilizer\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Determinado pela propriedade do fertilizante \"permaboost\".</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Minérios, metais e minerais</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Guias</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\">Metais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Metais</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\">Ferro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\">Ferro meteórico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt-br\">Ouro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt